#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:43 8faf1713b4214d3a8dd32fbfc6501c9a
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:44 e83e4693dcac435fa0e778e1f8e9741b
msgid ""
"The default RC input is configured on the UART3 (RX3/SBUS). Non SBUS,  "
"single wire serial inputs can be directly tied to RX3 if SBUS pin is left "
"unconnected. RC could  be applied instead at a different UART port such as "
"UART4 or UART8, and set the protocol to receive RC data: ``SERIALn_PROTOCOL "
"= 23`` and change :ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` to something "
"other than '23'."
msgstr ""
"默认 RC 输入配置在 UART3（RX3/SBUS）上。若 SBUS 引脚未连接，非 SBUS 单线串行输入可直接连接至 RX3。RC 也可改为连接至"
" UART4 或 UART8 等其他 UART 端口，并设置协议以接收 RC 数据：``SERIALn_PROTOCOL = 23``，同时将 "
":ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` 改为 「23」 以外的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:46 e82222c5a0384206980bb2a2f5f1adbf
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:47 7c034f619ca3413eaa158c3635950e1f
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX3 pin."
msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接至 RX3 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:48 7b6c0df36768467bb85817fe54698645
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to TX3. Set "
":ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` = 7"
msgstr "FPort 需连接至 TX3。设置 :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` = 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:49 d71753e1919f46569124ebe0573d921b
msgid ""
"CRSF/ELRS also requires both TX3 and RX3 connections and provides telemetry "
"automatically."
msgstr "CRSF/ELRS 同样需要 TX3 和 RX3 连接，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:52 e305deec1c7d4b68bccf9926d2c2ece6
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:53 3b861a9792e1427cbf228f90daf40d0c
msgid "DisplayPort OSD is available by default on the HD VTX connector."
msgstr "HD VTX 连接器上默认提供 DisplayPort OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:56 73b610d56b2142aea0318af66d6a9001
msgid "VTX Support"
msgstr "VTX 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:57 d565c08c1854431cbab353373151d647
msgid ""
"The SH1.0-6P connector supports a DJI Air Unit / HD VTX connection. Protocol"
" defaults to DisplayPort. Pin 1 of the connector is 10v so be careful not to"
" connect this to a peripheral requiring 5v. DisplayPort OSD is enabled by "
"default on SERIAL8."
msgstr ""
"SH1.0-6P 连接器支持 DJI Air Unit / HD VTX 连接，协议默认为 DisplayPort。连接器第 1 引脚为 "
"10V，请勿将其连接至需要 5V 的外设。SERIAL8 上默认启用 DisplayPort OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:60 a769f9b684024817bf553731cee9e564
msgid "VTX power control"
msgstr "VTX 电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:61 d5bafd8058e547e18922e5b89123990b
msgid ""
"GPIO 83 controls the VTX BEC output to pins marked \"12V\" and is included "
"on the HD VTX connector. Setting this GPIO low removes voltage supply to "
"this pin/pad. By default RELAY3 is configured to control this pin and sets "
"the GPIO high at boot."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 83 控制标记为「12V」引脚和 HD VTX 连接器的 VTX BEC 输出。将该 GPIO "
"设为低电平可断开该引脚/焊盘的供电。默认情况下，RELAY3 配置为控制此引脚，并在启动时将 GPIO 置为高电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:64 115dd2b6021c427cb5fe626e3239dd0a
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:65 393aa565981044739bd2229f30f93b09
msgid ""
"The autopilot supports up to 9 PWM (8 + LED) outputs. The pads for motor "
"output M1 to M8 are provided on both the motor connectors and on separate "
"pads, plus M9 on a separate pad for LED strip (default configuration) or "
"another PWM output."
msgstr ""
"飞控最多支持 9 路 PWM（8 路 + LED）输出。电机输出焊盘 M1 至 M8 在电机连接器和独立焊盘上均有提供，另有 M9 "
"在独立焊盘上，默认配置为 LED 灯带，也可用于其他 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:69 0517121c29d64089883c0afd338d4863
msgid "The PWM is in 4 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 4 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:71 6c53544e8ed7493692add64fa05dd6f0
msgid "PWM 1-4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-4 为第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:72 be34bee896734472ac6e40f95c5e2470
msgid "PWM 5-8 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5-8 为第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:73 a18544e3df614fc586fac5aa1bf3e425
msgid "PWM 9 (LED) in group3"
msgstr "PWM 9（LED）为第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:75 8beee1fe032d47f6bc0717c78f5a5a8f
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. Channels 1-8 support bi-directional dshot."
msgstr ""
"同组内的通道必须使用相同的输出频率。若某组中任一通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均须使用 DShot。通道 1-8 支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:80 b84ffc3cb41649eb95fcb122fb528b43
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:81 79a07496fc5143458c0ecdbbddd34216
msgid ""
"The board has a internal voltage sensor and connections on the ESC connector"
" for an external current sensor input. The voltage sensor can handle up to "
"6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "该板内置电压传感器，ESC 连接器上有外部电流传感器输入接口。电压传感器最高支持 6S 锂电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:83 fc53124e0fbe4a9cba99e9f0994cd0cf
msgid "The default battery parameters are:"
msgstr "默认电池参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:85 61219055d18340868271cd96033d7e1b
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:86 906e3457d46d44e892d1315968b278ae
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:87 0a2ed30495714b10b05605976e7c1555
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11 (CURR pin)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11（CURR 引脚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:88 c22006be4c0c456f9cb43fe5dec47088
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.0"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:89 8eb3d705ab394ead9226834c9c42c4ae
msgid ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 40"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 40"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:92 8ef9ffbee96e45ffa8f12bf2d59d3118
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:93 f05d34dd6ebe45a4b94c13a4174e142d
msgid ""
"The AEDROXH7 does not have a built-in compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL connector."
msgstr "AEDROXH7 没有内置罗盘，但可通过 SDA 和 SCL 连接器以 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:96 2d2cefa393fb47b88e4bc928a3a379bc
msgid "Additional GPIOs"
msgstr "附加 GPIO"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:97 4fa08467397b4e40ba50e40c27098b47
msgid ""
"The numbering of the two additional user GPIOs for PIN variables in "
"ArduPilot parameters is:"
msgstr "两个附加用户 GPIO 在 ArduPilot 参数中 PIN 编号为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:99 e14e250412b94fda80316ed6761d155b
msgid "GPIO1 pin is ArduPilot GPIO 81"
msgstr "GPIO1 引脚对应 ArduPilot GPIO 81"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:100 6bcc3b9de1424fa4ad170d6ffe11c2c7
msgid "GPIO2 pin is ArduPilot GPIO 82"
msgstr "GPIO2 引脚对应 ArduPilot GPIO 82"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:103 7ebe2641d5d64fa0a04adb50af350eb6
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:105 6d35662bd4834b1696a5b802be3a3ceb
msgid ""
"Firmware for the AEDROXH7 is available from `ArduPilot Firmware Server "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ under the ``AEDROXH7`` target."
msgstr ""
"AEDROXH7 的固件可在 `ArduPilot 固件服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 的 "
"``AEDROXH7`` 目标下找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:108 ec9c5075033049918c9bdc41e988aa30
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aedroxh7.rst:109 fbd85e3d8c45420d99ae11dd3ac2c6ba
msgid ""
"To flash firmware initially, connect USB while holding the bootloader button"
" and use DFU to load the ``with_bl.hex`` file. Subsequent updates can be "
"applied using ``.apj`` files through a ground station."
msgstr ""
"首次烧录固件时，按住引导程序按钮的同时连接 USB，使用 DFU 加载 ``with_bl.hex`` 文件。后续更新可通过地面站使用 ``.apj``"
" 文件进行。"
